'''Don Expresso''' appears during the [[Dwarven Mines#Mithril Gourmand|Mithril Gourmand]] event, located at {{Coords|37|202|-123}} in the [[Dwarven Village]]. He asks the players to bring him {{Item|Tasty Mithril|amount=200}}, obtained by mining in a specified location. If he isn't fed in time, he falls to the ground and eventually disappears. If he is fed, he lies down and goes to sleep{{Confirm}}.

One minute before '''Don Expresso''' disappears, the following chat message appears:
{{mctxt|e|italic=true|Don Expresso is leaving in 1 minute! Make sure to feed him everything you have before he leaves!}}

