== Tips ==
*The {{code|/tptodonexpresso}} command can be used to teleport to '''Don Expresso'''.
**This command is executed by clicking on a chat message when '''Don Expresso''' is about to leave in 20 seconds, but it also works sooner than that.

== Trivia ==
*For a few seconds after '''Don Expresso''' disappears, he can still be interacted with, and his name tag will still be visible.
*'''Don Expresso''''s name is likely a reference to a Hypixel staff member, {{RN|h|Donpireso}}.
<!--*If '''Don Expresso''' is given Tasty Mithril from a previous event, the Tasty Mithril will be wiped from your inventory without counting toward the event. &bDon Expresso will say the following: 'THIS OLD MITHRIL IS STALE! DON'T EVER FEED THIS TO ME AGAIN!'. and red text will also say '{{mctxt|c|<amount> Tasty Mithril pieces were removed from a different event!}}'.-->
*Feeding '''Don Expresso''' {{Item|Tasty Mithril}} for the first time will reward the player with the {{ach|A Good Review|ach=true}}.
*In his dialogue, "Mineadvisor" and "Dwelp" are references to the review apps [https://www.tripadvisor.com/ TripAdvisor] and [https://www.yelp.com/ Yelp].
*One of his dialogue lines {{RMT|MY FATHER WILL HEAR ABOUT THIS}} is likely a reference to threats that [[fandom:harrypotter:Draco_Malfoy|Draco Malfoy]], a character, often made to [[fandom:harrypotter:Harry_Potter|Harry Potter]] and his friends in J. K. Rowling's book series ''Harry Potter''.

